<title>SWEDEN: Volvo unit in accord with China.</title>
<headline>Volvo unit in accord with China.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volvo's boat-engine making unit Volvo Penta said on Friday it had signed an agreement with China's Wuxi Sida Industrial Enterprise Company, a unit of WDEW, for a joint venture on the manufacture and sales of Volvo Penta diesel engines in China.</p>
</text>
